        "actions": { "value": 1 },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>运行宏 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-macros.Macro.whbHuntBalloonM1]{要塞货气球}（参数 <code>valve</code>），或点宏菜单「开阀」。</p>\n<p>最多 3 阀。战斗中每轮按阀数推进充气（满 12 可放飞）。非战斗可用宏 <code>ready</code> 跳过等待。</p>\n<p>气阀 Tile 可绑 Active Tiles → 运行该宏，参数写 <code>valve</code> / <code>close</code>。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
